  "gameDescriptionHtml": "\n<b>Before They Wake</b> is a gripping third-person horror experience set in the 1980s. Step into the shoes of Alfred Baptiste as he embarks on a desperate quest for solace and a cure for a mutating virus. This virus has caused him temporary paraplegia, gradually impairing his mobility and strength.<p></p>\n<p>In this game, you’ll explore a series of tapes documenting Alfred’s journey from the onset of his paralysis to his relentless fight for survival and a cure.</p>\n<p>Embark on a journey into a mysterious realm where beauty and horror intertwine. Drive your truck through breathtaking yet unsettling landscapes, where every corner hides a new secret and the line between wonder and dread is dangerously thin.</p>\n<p>Discover a world where beauty and horror intertwine. Every stunning scene hides a hint of fear, making every moment a puzzle of wonder and dread. Unravel the mysteries as you navigate this captivating and chilling landscape.</p>\n<p><b>WATCH HIS TAPES AND SAVE ALFRED!</b></p>\n",
